<title>TURKEY: IMF officials warns Turkey on public finance.</title>
<headline>IMF officials warns Turkey on public finance.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of a visiting International Monetary Fund delegation on Thursday warned Turkey that it still needed to solve weaknesses in its public finances.</p>
<p>&quot;The fundamental problems of the structural weakness of public finances remain to be tackled,&quot; Hardy told reporters after a meeting with State Minister Ufuk Soylemez.</p>
</text>
